WP42 contract proof:

- Service activity capture uses a protocol-owned bounded inventory limit.
- Core inventory journal-event helpers are exported for service capture reuse.
- Deterministic service proof injects a temporary shortcut root instead of
  depending on host Start Menu contents.
- Projected inventory rows keep runtime and foreground state not-claimed.
- Environment-dependent default Windows inventory event counts remain bounded.

Validation:

- cargo test -p ocentra-parent-agent-service activity_capture
